        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek BTB-86351, Bar Back-to-Back Handle Pair</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Bar Back-to-Back Door Handle Set will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 2-1/4 inches thick. The Bar Back-to-Back Handle Pair comes packaged as a 2 pulls and mounting hardware. The Bar Door Pull Pair is available in 12 inch and 18 inch lengths. This Ladder Door Pull goes well with almost any decor. Choose from several beautiful finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. Packaged with 2 door pulls (1 door pull for each side of a door).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/bar-door-pull-emtek-86351\"><b>Bar Pull with Thru-Bolt Mounting</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Back-to-Back Bar Front Door Handle Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86351-specifications.pdf?v=1704262360\"><b>Emtek Bar Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-BTB-86351:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 15-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-BTB-86352:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 21-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back-to-Back mounting.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-levers-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354533\" width=\"599\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek